  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 3.0% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $15.74B (3.0% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/defi/2026-09-10-uniswap-stablepair-hook-414160\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Uniswap launches \u2018StablePair Hook\u2019 to help LPs capture more stablecoin trading value</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/the-amc-fight-turned-into-an-industry-argument-over-which-tokenized-stock-model-wins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The AMC Fight Turned Into An Industry Argument Over Which Tokenized Stock Model Wins</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ethena Brings USDe and sUSDe to TRON, Expanding Digital Dollar Access Across Its Stablecoin Ecosystem</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/anchorage-digital-adds-institutional-access-to-frgmnts-fusd-stablecoin?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anchorage Digital adds institutional access to Frgmnt\u2019s fUSD stablecoin</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
